WEBVTT

00:00.280 --> 00:01.960
Hello, I'm Vanina Vitale.

00:02.120 --> 00:05.654
I am the founder and director of
Healing Me, Healing You,

00:05.720 --> 00:07.680
Center for Spiritual Life.

00:08.080 --> 00:11.640
This is a home where you will be able
to reconnect with yourself,

00:11.840 --> 00:14.614
where we will give you all the tools so that

00:14.680 --> 00:16.880
you can evolve and heal.

00:17.200 --> 00:22.094
On this page you will find endless possibilities, all for you,

00:22.160 --> 00:24.920
so you can feel much better.
